  "notes": [
    "Moves the downloadable alpha to Godot. Everyone in a co-op group must update; Unity and Godot players cannot join each other.",
    "Restores the incident-folder menus, skull difficulties, five settings tabs, pause screen and scoreboard. Menu feedback is shorter and substantially quieter, with softer music and no automatic focus blips.",
    "Restores original station surfaces and maintenance room, timber potting house, dimensional hedge foliage, curved hedge joins and outdoor haze.",
    "Repairs hunter opening patrols, movement-noise investigation, pursuit and stationary catches. The solo run starts when you cross the entrance; the host entrance seals across the co-op party after crossing.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game and choose Update & restart in the launcher. The full installer replaces the previous game files; solo remains available offline. Godot starts with its own settings; configure your microphone under Settings > Voice Chat."
  ],
